(a) the present status, estimated cost, executing agency and scheduled timeline for development of the airport at Mamnoor, Warangal, Telangana;
(b) whether tenders for the project have been floated and awarded, if so, the details thereof, including the present stage of implementation and the expected date of commencement of flight operations; 
